    ␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀H'␀␀\'␀␀`'␀␀␀␀␀␀Convert an HSV value to RGB.

    Automatic clipping.

    Parameters
    ----------
    R : int
        From 0. - 255.
    G : int
        From 0. - 255.
    B : int
        From 0. - 255.

